OL,3,GNEWSAPundit and ex-rugby player cleared
OL,4,Aof sex assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said: "It's ruined me personally,
OL,7,Fmy confidence, my whole being - but not
OL,8,Fonly that, it's taken away my career,
OL,9,Fmy reputation, my whole character that
OL,10,Fmy whole life was built around."
